Feature: AI Call Analysis # tests/bdd/features/call_process/call_analysis.feature:1
  As a quality assurance manager
  I want AI-powered analysis of call transcripts
  So that I can automatically evaluate agent performance
  Feature: AI Call Analysis  # tests/bdd/features/call_process/call_analysis.feature:1

  @analysis @compliance
  Scenario: Analyze PDPA compliance                  # tests/bdd/features/call_process/call_analysis.feature:10
    Given the AI analyzer is configured              # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:41
    Given a transcript with customer data discussion # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:720
    When AI analysis is performed                    # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:454
    Then PDPA compliance score should be calculated  # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:497
    And compliance violations should be flagged      # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:504
    And the analysis should include:                 # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:1032
      | field            | presence |
      | pdpa_score       | required |
      | pdpa_compliant   | required |
      | violations       | required |
      | compliance_notes | optional |

  @analysis @compliance @violation
  Scenario: Detect compliance violations                                # tests/bdd/features/call_process/call_analysis.feature:23
    Given the AI analyzer is configured                                 # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:41
    Given a transcript where agent shared customer data without consent # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:731
    When AI analysis is performed                                       # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:454
    Then PDPA compliance score should be below 80                       # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:849
    And at least one violation should be flagged                        # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:856
    And the violation details should be documented                      # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:862

  @analysis @grading
  Scenario: Generate performance grading         # tests/bdd/features/call_process/call_analysis.feature:31
    Given the AI analyzer is configured          # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:41
    Given a transcript of a sales call           # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:739
    When AI analysis is performed                # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:454
    Then 16 grading elements should be evaluated # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:510
    And overall score should be calculated       # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:516
    And each grading element should include:     # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:1039
      | field     | type   |
      | element   | string |
      | score     | number |
      | max_score | number |
      | feedback  | string |

  @analysis @grading @elements
  Scenario: Verify grading elements                        # tests/bdd/features/call_process/call_analysis.feature:44
    Given the AI analyzer is configured                    # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:41
    Given a complete sales call transcript                 # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:747
    When AI analysis is performed                          # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:454
    Then the following grading elements should be present: # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:1046
      | element            |
      | Greeting           |
      | Needs Discovery    |
      | Product Knowledge  |
      | Objection Handling |
      | Closing            |
      | Professionalism    |
      | Active Listening   |
      | Empathy            |
      | Clarity            |
      | Pace               |
      | Hold Procedure     |
      | Transfer Procedure |
      | Documentation      |
      | Follow-up          |
      | Time Management    |
      | Overall            |

  @analysis @sentiment
  Scenario: Extract sentiment analysis          # tests/bdd/features/call_process/call_analysis.feature:67
    Given the AI analyzer is configured         # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:41
    Given a transcript with emotional content   # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:753
    When AI analysis is performed               # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:454
    Then overall sentiment should be determined # tests/bdd/steps/call_process_steps.py:522
