Feature: Live Call Processing End-to-End # tests/bdd/features/call_process/live_call_processing.feature:1
  As a contact center manager
  I want to process real Webex CC calls through the complete pipeline
  So that I can verify the system works with actual data
  Feature: Live Call Processing End-to-End  # tests/bdd/features/call_process/live_call_processing.feature:1

  @live @smoke
